hTwo":null},{"on":true,"lora":"Krea 2 pussy.safetensors","strength":0.3,"strengthTwo":null},{},""],"widgets_values_named":{"divider":{},"PowerLoraLoaderHeaderWidget":{"type":"PowerLoraLoaderHeaderWidget"},"lora_1":{"on":false,"lora":"Krea 2 NSFW V4.safetensors","strength":1,"strengthTwo":null},"lora_2":{"on":true,"lora":"KREA 2 Mystic XXX v3.safetensors","strength":1,"strengthTwo":null},"lora_3":{"on":false,"lora":null,"strength":0,"strengthTwo":null},"lora_4":{"on":true,"lora":"Krea 2 pussy.safetensors","strength":0.3,"strengthTwo":null},"➕ Add Lora":""}},{"id":48,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-479.22190202020863,-386.8802312904865],"size":[721.375,748.703125],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"图生图使用说明","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# Krea2 图生图使用说明\n\n流程:上传参考图 → 等比缩放 → 图→Latent → KSampler 按 denoise 重绘(默认 0.6)。\n\n## 重绘三档(KSampler 的 denoise)\n- **0.30 ~ 0.40 贴近原图微调**:只换光影/质感/小物件,构图人物不动\n- **0.55 ~ 0.65 均衡推荐**:保构图与人物特征,内容可较大改动\n- **0.85+ 几乎重画**:只留大致轮廓与配色,细节全部重画\n\n## 等比缩放节点\n第 2 格 = 目标百万像素(1.0 ≈ 1024×1024)。按参考图长宽比等比缩放,大图会自动降到目标规模,防止超内存。\n\n## 提示词\nTE=官方 Krea2-Engineer-V1 + Rebalance 破限链。写「想要的结果」,不要复述原图;denoise 越低,提示词影响越弱。\n\n## 注意\nNSFW 内容仅限成年角色。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# Krea2 图生图使用说明\n\n流程:上传参考图 → 等比缩放 → 图→Latent → KSampler 按 denoise 重绘(默认 0.6)。\n\n## 重绘三档(KSampler 的 denoise)\n- **0.30 ~ 0.40 贴近原图微调**:只换光影/质感/小物件,构图人物不动\n- **0.55 ~ 0.65 均衡推荐**:保构图与人物特征,内容可较大改动\n- **0.85+ 几乎重画**:只留大致轮廓与配色,细节全部重画\n\n## 等比缩放节点\n第 2 格 = 目标百万像素(1.0 ≈ 1024×1024)。按参考图长宽比等比缩放,大图会自动降到目标规模,防止超内存。\n\n## 提示词\nTE=官方 Krea2-Engineer-V1 + Rebalance 破限链。写「想要的结果」,不要复述原图;denoise 越低,提示词影响越弱。\n\n## 注意\nNSFW 内容仅限成年角色。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":78,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[1899.8645536545048,-273.6939438571683],"size":[315,350],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"}